$ CBUSH followed by an empty line, which is read as a blank continuation entry. It must not change the element: V vector
$ orientation and S = 0.5. The bug reset CID to 0, so the element axes were basic instead of those from the V vector.
SOL 101
CEND
SPC = 1
LOAD = 1
DISP = ALL
BEGIN BULK
GRID,1,,0.,0.,0.
GRID,2,,2.,1.,0.5
CBUSH,1,1,1,2,0.,0.,1.

PBUSH,1,K,1000.,2000.,3000.,4000.,5000.,6000.
SPC1,1,123456,1
FORCE,1,2,,1.,1.,2.,3.
MOMENT,1,2,,1.,.4,.5,.6
ENDDATA
